IngeTrazo (upstream)
--------------------
    Built began as a fork of IngeTrazo and contains its code and history.
    Its authors keep their copyright.

Marco Sumari Tellez
    Civil Engineer, Arequipa, Peru. Creator and lead author of IngeTrazo.

